    <data key="d0">Sanofi Secure Data Analytics Portal Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2L0m28ZLmtE</data>
    <data key="d2">This architecture supports 30 to 40 data scientists processing real-world evidence (RWE) smart datasets with strict data isolation, encryption, and auditability on AWS.</data>
    <data key="d3">Healthcare &amp; Life Sciences, Security &amp; Authentication, Data Analytics &amp; AI/ML</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
